<%
      metamagic site: "Connected City",
                title: ["About Us", :site],
                separator: " — "
%>
<div class="about-page-wrapper">
    <div class="about-page-item">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="span12">
                <div class="about-title"><h1>About</h1></div>
                <div class="about-sub-heading">
                    <h3>
                        <b>ConnectedCity&trade;</b> helps local marketplaces thrive in the digital world.
                    </h3>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="span4">
              <%= image_tag 'about_img.png' %>
            </div>
            <div class="span8">
                <h4>Our Vision: Sustainable local communities.</h4>
                <p>
                  <b>ConnectedCity&trade;</b> empowers local businesses to reach and communicate
                    with shoppers to drive local spending and achieve sustainable
                    economic growth.
                </p>

                <h4>Our Mission: Buy local.</h4>
                <p>
                  <b>ConnectedCity&trade;</b> is more than just a philosophy it is a practical tool for keeping money circulating in your local economy.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


    <div class="about-page-item">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="span12">
            <div class="about-title"><h1>Shoppers</h1></div>
            <div class="about-sub-heading">
                <h3>
                    <b>ConnectedCity&trade;</b> saves shoppers time searching for local shopping opportunities.
                </h3>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="span4">
          <%= image_tag 'shopping_img.png' %>
        </div>
        <div class="span8">

            <p><b>ConnectedShopper&trade;</b> is a shopping management application that helps you personalize your shopping experience to stay informed about local opportunities in real-time.</p>
            <p>
                Features and benefits include:

                <ul>
                    <li>Organize and manage your favorite businesses and their real-time updates</li>
                    <li>Find merchants that sell your favorite brands</li>
                    <li>Claim deals and coupons</li>
                    <li>Earn loyalty rewards</li>
                    <li>Share shopping opportunities with friends</li>
                    <li>Share recommendations with friends</li>
                    <li>Win free stuff</li>
                    <li>And more!</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-page-item">
      <div class="about-title"><h1>Businesses</h1></div>
      <div class="about-sub-heading">
        <h3>
          <b>ConnectedCity&trade;</b> saves businesses time and money promoting their brands,
          products and services locally.
        </h3>
      </div>

        <div class="flexslider">
          <ul class="slides">
            <li>
              <div class="span4">
                <%= image_tag 'connected_advertiser.png' %>
              </div>
              <div class="span8">
                <h4><b>ConnectedAdvertiser&trade;</b> or merchants and service providers.</h4>
                <p>
                  <b>ConnectedAdvertiser&trade;</b> is a marketing management application that provides local businesses with online tools for promoting a comprehensive range of updates to targeted local shoppers in real-time.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Features and benefits include:
                  <ul>
                    <li>Lower marketing costs</li>
                    <li>Sell more products and services</li>
                    <li>Increased profits</li>
                    <li>Promote marketing updates in real-time</li>
                    <li>Build subscribers to your marketing updates</li>
                    <li>Broadcast video updates, product demos and online programs</li>
                    <li>Promote contests and events</li>
                    <li>Collect market research data</li>
                    <li>Promote special offers, deals and coupons</li>
                    <li>Promote job opportunities</li>
                  </ul>
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
                <div class="span4">
                  <%= image_tag 'connected_agent.png' %>
                </div>
                <div class="span8">
                  <h4><b>ConnectedAgent&trade; for Realtors&reg;</b></h4>
                  <p>
                    <b>ConnectedAgent&trade;</b> provides Realtors&reg; with a personal media channel for promoting personal brands, property listings and marketing updates to local residents and real estate shoppers.
                  </p>
                  <p>
                    Features and benefits include:
                      <ul>
                        <li>Promote residential and commercial real estate listings through IDX import</li>
                        <li>Promote open houses, recent sales, and new listings</li>
                        <li>Build a fan base and subscribers to receive your updates</li>
                        <li>Broadcast personal and property video updates</li>
                      </ul>
                  </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="span4">
                <%= image_tag 'connected_broker.png' %>
              </div>
              <div class="span8">
                <h4><b>ConnectedBroker&trade;</b> for Real Estate Brokers</h4>
                <p>
                  <b>ConnectedBroker&trade;</b> provides real estate brokers with a company media channel for promoting company brands, real estate agents, property listings and company updates to local residents and real estate shoppers.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Features and benefits include:
                  <ul>
                    <li>Promote residential and commercial real estate listings via IDX import</li>
                    <li>Promote open houses, recent sales and new listings in real time</li>
                    <li>Build a fan base and subscribers to your media updates</li>
                    <li>Promote your current agents and recruit new agents</li>
                  </ul>
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="span4">
                <%= image_tag 'connected_builder.png' %>
              </div>
              <div class="span8">
                <h4><b>ConnectedBuilder&trade;</b> for home builders and real estate developers</h4>
                <p>
                  <b>ConnectedBuilder&trade;</b> provides new home builders and real estate developers with a company media channel for promoting company brands, new home communities and media updates to local residents and new home shoppers.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Features and benefits include:
                    <ul>
                        <li>Promote your company profile</li>
                        <li>Promote new home community profiles and unit profiles</li>
                        <li>Broadcast marketing updates to new home shoppers</li>
                        <li>Build a fan base and subscribers to your media updates</li>
                        <li>Recruit new employees</li>
                    </ul>
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="span4">
                <%= image_tag 'connected_landlord.png' %>
              </div>
              <div class="span8">
                <h4><b>ConnectedLandlord&trade;</b> for landlords and property managers</h4>
                <p>
                  <b>ConnectedLandlord&trade;</b> provides landlords and rental property managers with a company media channel for managing the promotion of rental housing, online applications and agreements, tenant screening, service provisioning, rent payments and tenant communications.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Features and benefits include:
                    <ul>
                      <li>Promote your company profile</li>
                      <li>Promote rental properties and rental unit vacancies</li>
                      <li>Manage online tenancy applications, agreements and inspection reports</li>
                      <li>Assist tenant set-up of utilities, telecom, TV, internet, insurance and rent payments</li>
                      <li>Manage online communication with tenants</li>
                    </ul>
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-page-item">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="span12">
            <div class="about-title">
                <h1>Associations</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="about-sub-heading">
                <h3>
                    <b>ConnectedCity&trade;</b> helps local business associations stay connected to members
                    and customer markets and drive economic activity to their shopping districts.
                </h3>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
          <div class="span4">
            <%= image_tag 'association_img.png' %>
          </div>
          <div class="span8">
            <p><b>ConnectedAssocation&trade;</b> for local business associations.</p>
            <p><b>ConnectedAssociation&trade;</b> provides local business associations with an online social marketplace for promoting business member updates to local residents and visitors in real-time.</p>
            <p>
                Features and benefits include:

                <ul>
                  <li>Build business association brand awareness</li>
                  <li>Engage and coordinate marketing strategies with business members</li>
                  <li>Engage with local residents</li>
                  <li>Crime prevention</li>
                  <li>Event promotion</li>
                  <li>Market data collection</li>
                  <li>And more!</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
          </div>
      </div>
    </div>
</div>



